{{## Idiomatic Scriban -- large-loop (phase 9; authoring standard D16).

     Patterns followed, from Scriban's own documentation:
       language          https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/language.md
       builtins/html     https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/builtins.md#html-functions
       runtime/includes  https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/runtime.md

     The display name is composed template-side as `row-` plus the value substitution (ledger
     E21) -- the model carries data, never display strings. Checked by the functional
     verifier, not the byte gate. Note the multi-line comment delimiters: the single-line
     form ends at the first newline, which would leave the doc URLs to parse as
     expressions. ##}}

{{~ for item in items ~}}
  <tr><td>row-{{ item.value }}</td><td>{{ item.value }}</td></tr>
{{~ end ~}}
